Z||000000||fierochild||08-11-2001||09:45 PM||||The Georgia Fiero Club would like to invite all Fiero fanatics in the area to join us for a local mountain cruise Saturday Sep 8th.<BR>We will meet at Ryans Steakhouse in Canton Ga. at 11am for brunch.  Then depart Canton approximately 12:00 proceeding up I 575/515 to Blue Ridge where we will pick up Ga 2/60 for a cruise through the North Georgia Mountains.  Details will be posted to the Georgia Fieros web page or you can contact me direct. For those of you going to the Run For The Hills it can serve as a primer to be certain everything is ready for the serious stuff.  ||||reg||6
